        "Manager"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "afaab087-26db-4b7f-8d03-e8a2a836e0cf",
      "content": "Manager Responsibilities\n\nManagers are responsible for setting clear expectations, maintaining team operating rhythm, supporting employee growth, approving time off, and escalating risks early. Managers should document important decisions and keep role expectations current.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002006",
      "document_id": "MGR-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Manager"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "4e2d3ea0-2946-459e-96c1-f0c76a69109f",
      "content": "Performance Documentation\n\nPerformance feedback should include specific examples, business impact, expected behavior, and follow-up actions. Managers should avoid vague labels and should distinguish between skill gaps, behavior concerns, and role mismatch.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002006",
      "document_id": "MGR-002",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Manager"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "facb837a-ace7-4994-ae31-1385a5333b0c",
      "content": "Team Planning\n\nManagers should maintain a quarterly team plan with goals, ownership, dependencies, and risks. Plans should identify customer-impacting work, hiring assumptions, and capacity constraints.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002006",
      "document_id": "MGR-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Manager"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "8b213ffe-0c4d-4f2c-9ed0-fe15df3ad7c6",
      "content": "Conflict Handling\n\nManagers should address team conflict early, document observed behavior, and avoid making unsupported conclusions about intent. Repeated conduct concerns should be discussed with People Operations.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002006",
      "document_id": "MGR-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
